### Describe the bug

Bug found while migrating actual project from CRA to Vite using defaults. Valid JS code is transpired incorrectly. Reproducible on the default configuration via `npx swc` or the playground.

### Input code

```typescript
const messages = [{ message: 'hello' }];
const logs = messages.map(({ log = () => console.log(message), message }) => log);
logs[0]();
```


### Config

```json
{
  "jsc": {
    "parser": {
      "syntax": "ecmascript",
      "jsx": false
    },
    "target": "es5",
    "loose": false,
    "minify": {
      "compress": false,
      "mangle": false
    }
  },
  "module": {
    "type": "es6"
  },
  "minify": false,
  "isModule": true
}
```


